@host = http://localhost:5111
@token = paste-access-token-here

GET {{host}}/health

### Create a tenant
POST {{host}}/api/platform/tenants
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Acme Relocations",
  "slug": "acme-relocations",
  "contactEmail": "ops@acme.test",
  "phone": "+91 90000 00000",
  "address": "Bengaluru"
}

### Login as system administrator (development bootstrap account)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@movers.local",
  "password": "ChangeMe123!"
}

### Resolve current tenant from the signed token
GET {{host}}/api/tenant/current
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
